<node id="hierba:amanita-muscaria-aga"><data key="n_label">Aga, Fly Agaric</data><data key="n_type">Hierba</data><data key="n_source">Duke JA et al. Handbook of Medicinal Herbs, 2nd ed. CRC Press, 2002</data><data key="n_chapter">Catalog of Herbs (A to Z)</data><data key="n_section">AGA, FLY AGARIC</data><data key="n_page">3</data><data key="n_scientific">Amanita muscaria</data><data key="n_safety">X</data><data key="n_safety_raw">X</data><data key="n_dosages">Don’t take it (JAD).</data><data key="n_downsides">Signs of intoxication include confusion, cramps, dizziness, enteralgia, mania, psychostimulation, then sedation vomiting (PH2).</data></node>
