<node id="hierba:malus-domestica-borkh-apple"><data key="n_label">Apple</data><data key="n_type">Hierba</data><data key="n_description">Sinónimos: M. malus (L.) Britton, M. pumila auct., M. pumila var. domestica (Borkh.) C. K. Schneid, M. sylvestris auct., M. sylvestris var. domestica (Borkh.) Mansf., Pyrus malus L.</data><data key="n_source">Duke JA et al. Handbook of Medicinal Herbs, 2nd ed. CRC Press, 2002</data><data key="n_chapter">Catalog of Herbs (A to Z)</data><data key="n_section">APPLE</data><data key="n_page">34</data><data key="n_scientific">Malus domestica Borkh.</data><data key="n_safety">+++</data><data key="n_safety_raw">+++</data><data key="n_dosages">Boil tart apple in 1 pint water for fever (FEL).</data><data key="n_downsides">Not covered (AHP; KOM).“Hazards and/or side effects not known for proper therapeutic dosages” (PH2) (but PH2 designates no specific quantified dosage! JAD).</data></node>
