<node id="hierba:pimenta-racemosa-bayrum-tree"><data key="n_label">Bayrum Tree</data><data key="n_type">Hierba</data><data key="n_source">Duke JA et al. Handbook of Medicinal Herbs, 2nd ed. CRC Press, 2002</data><data key="n_chapter">Catalog of Herbs (A to Z)</data><data key="n_section">BAYRUM TREE</data><data key="n_page">65</data><data key="n_scientific">Pimenta racemosa (Mill.) J. W. Moore.</data><data key="n_safety">+++</data><data key="n_safety_raw">+++</data><data key="n_dosages">Leaf held in the mouth to help quit smoking (JFM); 4 seeds in 1 cup of water as stimulant (JFM).</data><data key="n_downsides">Not covered (AHP).“Hazards and/or side effects not known for proper therapeutic dosages” (PH2). Some people react to eugenol (PH2).</data></node>
