<node id="hierba:terminalia-bellirica-belleric"><data key="n_label">Belleric</data><data key="n_type">Hierba</data><data key="n_description">Sinónimos: Myrobalanus bellirica Gaertn.</data><data key="n_source">Duke JA et al. Handbook of Medicinal Herbs, 2nd ed. CRC Press, 2002</data><data key="n_chapter">Catalog of Herbs (A to Z)</data><data key="n_section">BELLERIC</data><data key="n_page">70</data><data key="n_scientific">Terminalia bellirica (Gaertn.) Roxb.</data><data key="n_safety">+</data><data key="n_safety_raw">+</data><data key="n_dosages">1–3 g (KAP).</data><data key="n_downsides">Class 1 (AHP). Not covered (KOM; PHR). Ethanolic extract LD50 = 4250 mg/kg orl mouse (HH2). All the FNF 1's are for the high tannin content of the Terminalia.</data></node>
