<node id="hierba:cichorium-endivia-l-endive"><data key="n_label">Endive</data><data key="n_type">Hierba</data><data key="n_source">Duke JA et al. Handbook of Medicinal Herbs, 2nd ed. CRC Press, 2002</data><data key="n_chapter">Catalog of Herbs (A to Z)</data><data key="n_section">ENDIVE</data><data key="n_page">272</data><data key="n_scientific">Cichorium endivia L.</data><data key="n_safety">+++</data><data key="n_safety_raw">+++</data><data key="n_dosages">Food farmacy (JAD). Interpreted by some as one of the bitter herbs of the Bible.</data><data key="n_downsides">Not covered (AHP; KOM; PH2).</data></node>
